<title>PORTUGAL: Sonae buys remaining stake in Brazil's CRD.</title>
<headline>Sonae buys remaining stake in Brazil's CRD.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sonae Distribuicao, a unit of Sonae Investimentos, bought more than 50 percent of Brazil's Companhia Real de Distribuicao (CRD) to take its stake to 100 percent, the group said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company said that the acquisition was in line with its declared policy of expanding in the Brazilian market.</p>
<p>CRD has four hypermarkets and 23 supermarkets which sold a total 72 billion escudos ($413 million).</p>
<p>--Lisbon bureau 3511-3150035</p>
</text>
